# Documentation files use an explicit opt-in policy.
*

# Allow Git to traverse documentation subdirectories.
!*/

# Keep documentation policy files and approved source/delivery formats.
!.gitignore
!**/.gitignore
!**/*.tex
!**/*.pdf
!**/*.md

# Keep only the reviewed configuration for the isolated formatter experiment.
!experiments/mago-1.57.0-pilot.toml
